// The world asked a question no one item answers: the Wikidata Query Service (SPARQL, CC0).
// "The tallest mountain" is the mountain with the most of the quantity mountains are measured
// by that "tall" means, read from Wiktionary ("superlative form of tall", "of greater than
// average height") and from which quantities mountains have. Written by scripts/pack.mjs from
// sources/sparql (edit those, not this).
Requires(Core(), Basic(), Code())

Concept(Superlative(), IsA(Result()))

Concept(Either(), IsA(Result()))
